      "clipStart": 8,
      "label": "The gap",
      "startFrame": 2396,
      "durationFrames": 381,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Now it reads that passage against the firm's own control.",
          "src": "audio/blocked-0.wav",
          "startFrame": 0,
          "durationFrames": 90
        },
        {
          "text": "The period is stated. The starting point is not.",
          "src": "audio/blocked-1.wav",
          "startFrame": 99,
          "durationFrames": 81
        },
        {
          "text": "So no due date is calculated. The clock stays blocked, and the gap goes in front of a person.",
