      "kind": "clip",
      "clip": "decide",
      "clipStart": 12,
      "label": "A named decision",
      "startFrame": 2777,
      "durationFrames": 605,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "The decision belongs to a named officer, and the tool enforces the order it has to happen in.",
          "src": "audio/decide-0.wav",
          "startFrame": 0,
          "durationFrames": 153
        },
        {
          "text": "It will not accept a reading until every section the answer depends on has been read and fingerprinted.",
          "src": "audio/decide-1.wav",
          "startFrame": 162,
          "durationFrames": 147
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the officer's own reading is time stamped, before the draft interpretation is ever revealed.",
